<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0025.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 3.0025.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0025 against the dollar, up from 3.0145 on Friday and at 1.8150 against the mark, down from 1.8110, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.99 percent from the central bank's weighted dollar and mark parity rates, up from Friday's 2.80 percent. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
